  "details": "It would be nice to have a way for users and independent brands to have private worlds and more player slots then normally allowed. We could also have special perms for Group+ worlds, and persistent group instances. For example being able to do a Group+ world where no others can make instances of it and they have to join your group instance so you have full control of what happens in there.\n\nThis is just a baseline idea and obviously needs expanding however I wanted to share it here.",
